  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as both a noun and a suru verb. Specifically refers to the broadcasting of visual content (TV programs, films). Slightly more formal than {放送|ほうそう} (broadcasting), which covers both radio and television.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {放映|ほうえい}する: to broadcast, to screen\n- {放映|ほうえい}される: to be broadcast\n- {放映|ほうえい}{開始|かいし}: start of broadcasting\n- {放映|ほうえい}{中|ちゅう}: currently airing\n- {放映|ほうえい}{権|けん}: broadcasting rights\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {放送|ほうそう}: broadcasting (radio and TV, broader term)\n- {上映|じょうえい}: screening (specifically at a movie theater)",
